diff --git a/docs/plugin-packages.md b/docs/plugin-packages.md
index 4037c2166..337650eaf 100644
--- a/docs/plugin-packages.md
+++ b/docs/plugin-packages.md
@@ -19,6 +19,8 @@ The host's generic launcher proof accepts `IPOLLOWORK_EVAL_WORKBENCHES` as a JSO
 
 ## Package layout
 
+Local desktop imports can request review for unsigned packages with local services. The import dialog shows owned files, service source, permissions, and a SHA-256 fingerprint. Installation requires checking the review checkbox and resending that exact fingerprint through the authenticated desktop host. Remote clients, GitHub imports, and unapproved packages retain the declarative-only restrictions. Changed bytes invalidate approval. Local review does not permit engine bindings, native binaries, authorization forms, or device permissions and does not mark the publisher as officially signed.
+
 Every unpacked package starts with `ipollowork.plugin.json`. Resource paths are relative to that directory and may not escape it.
 
 ```text
